# The wallet modules are published with SHA-256 hashes in
# public/tera/wallet/manifest.json, and the page checks itself against them.
# A checkout that rewrites their line endings changes their bytes and so their
# hashes, which would report a healthy build as modified. Pin them to LF so the
# published hashes are reproducible from a checkout on any platform.
public/tera/wallet/*.js text eol=lf
public/tera/wallet/*.css text eol=lf
public/tera/wallet/manifest.json text eol=lf
